  "route_rules":["Routes are transport adapters only; they never calculate authoritative Objective envelope, aggregate, Task outcome or execution state from client payloads.","Every mutating route uses COMMAND_ENVELOPE_V1 and LLD-12 browser mutation protection; query previews remain side-effect-free unless the named command contract explicitly owns durable non-authoritative proposal persistence.","Objective scheduling timezone affects Task/Objective schedule interpretation only; it does not alter ordinary/SLA chronology, which remains America/Guayaquil under its owning contracts.","Source WFM plan, current SOMA Task plan, Objective membership-pinned plan/envelope and actual execution remain separate DTO/projection authorities.","LLD-10 may compose preview/confirmation flows over these routes but cannot bypass LLD-05 command guards or mutate domain tables directly."]
